{"title":"Shovel Research Updates the WRT 2 and Now Offers Aluminum Barrel Adjusters","link":"https://theradavist.com/shovel-research-updates","date":1788872445000,"content":"<p><em><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/shovel-research\" target=\"_blank\">Shovel Research</a> is now offering its barrel adjusters in <a href=\"https://shovelresearch.com/aluminum-barrel-adjusters\" target=\"_blank\">Aluminum</a> ($36 for two) as well as an updated WRT 2 ($71 for two)…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/a0f4f39858ad61bb1c8c80b374744e67999691d5bcad0823f87a50c7716a9d92.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/983a8fd79364f92ff6288826a45c2d0ee58b3f67a0358d078801e924f9df2c60.jpg 800w, /media/a0f4f39858ad61bb1c8c80b374744e67999691d5bcad0823f87a50c7716a9d92.jpg 1600w, /media/fd12681637bc68efeac050b70a53b166b0756816c96f83ee2d2f9df3906b7f3f.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/3b259ef2b09915ca0a6b1af04e3f6fe0622a8c883fa4f99d54f926bb4b27850d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/58f0e0ce7be59e4ea02f85241f94eef0559641f1677a6c5a7f852cd614b2d13f.jpg 800w, /media/3b259ef2b09915ca0a6b1af04e3f6fe0622a8c883fa4f99d54f926bb4b27850d.jpg 1600w, /media/ae0122a97639278d968c3f29a914b89c002bb473db9ffcc1f9f7de2d8718130e.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/7b649ef0d1924be919648754177a0d60ee6919d922475e3bb4f58b78e0a7fef3.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/2e01891c3a8628efac2945db6414a78bbacf5b25f68bcbd0218d9728fa46cf27.jpg 800w, /media/7b649ef0d1924be919648754177a0d60ee6919d922475e3bb4f58b78e0a7fef3.jpg 1600w, /media/bb6937602c465676b2ab461b7bf6c9fda34ab258fdc553651535f493cf749ac9.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Sal also made a few updates to their <a href=\"https://shovelresearch.com/wrt-hanger\" target=\"_blank\">WRT 2</a>, now featuring a custom-designed and locally machined stainless shoulder bolt for the pulley. Please note that parts from WRT 1 and WRT 2 are not interchangeable. Both are machined just across the river from Portland in nearby Washington.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/486be1cb55f04c9dcccc68fbf4edb98abb2912d9acd0c8d2ba0d3f0f8fff4744.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/baf5a6b4e59d8864dec60fcdbafd543bcf8ce2859cd8da0bcfe7ab25edfd54ef.jpg 800w, /media/7891c0067718466c5334bb6f266ad506a59e4f006e83b43faa10b99c099bb0b6.jpg 1600w, /media/486be1cb55f04c9dcccc68fbf4edb98abb2912d9acd0c8d2ba0d3f0f8fff4744.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/6358f1cc6a025cd2e065142a8993eb256e3b03ee9eda696daf586988aa647508.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/adfc20aea5c9894ed2427ebe43770346aab078ebcfb1ecbfb11edb7446f7032a.jpg 800w, /media/538bae59bb22b7d40d1f083e9af7821bdb918439c2b2f3713ef6e674302caac3.jpg 1600w, /media/6358f1cc6a025cd2e065142a8993eb256e3b03ee9eda696daf586988aa647508.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Find out more and get the best bits for your build over at<a href=\"https://shovelresearch.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Shovel Research. </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/shovel-research-updates\">Shovel Research Updates the WRT 2 and Now Offers Aluminum Barrel Adjusters</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"spencer harding","comments":"https://theradavist.com/shovel-research-updates#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"88c294cfe7e626095d99262bdfc9c110bc71f97985338aab332d0945ce92acec","category":"Cycling"}